       IDENTIFICATION DIVISION.
       PROGRAM-ID. LEVEL88.
       DATA DIVISION.
       WORKING-STORAGE SECTION.
       01 STATUS-CD PIC X VALUE "A".
          88 ACTIVE VALUE "A".
          88 CLOSED VALUE "C" "X".
       PROCEDURE DIVISION.
           IF ACTIVE DISPLAY "active" END-IF
           MOVE "X" TO STATUS-CD
           IF CLOSED DISPLAY "closed" END-IF
           STOP RUN.
